From 6fd17739492b01c6111e40245a982aa152dc2b12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yixun Lan <dlan@gentoo.org>
Date: Tue, 14 Apr 2026 07:18:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/33] phy: sunxi: add combo PHY

Enable PCIe functionality has been added and tested.

Signed-off-by: Yixun Lan <dlan@gentoo.org>
---
 drivers/phy/Kconfig                  |   6 +
 drivers/phy/Makefile                 |   2 +
 drivers/phy/sunxi-cadence-combophy.c | 584 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 592 insertions(+)
